p;d=mm&amp;r=g\" height=\"46\" width=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\n\n\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/author/ufukozturk/?lang=en\" title=\"Posts by Ufuk Ozturk\" rel=\"author\">Ufuk Ozturk</a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<span>Friday, 26 January 2018</span>\n\t\t\t<span>/</span>\n\t\t\t<span>Published in</span> <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/category/genel/?lang=en\" rel=\"category tag\">Genel</a>\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/corum-incesu-hidroelektrik-santrali-anlasmasi/?lang=en\" rel=\"bookmark\">ÇORUM İNCESU HYDROELECTRIC POWER PLANT AGREEMENT</a></h3>\n\n    \n\n        \n\n    \n\n<p>İncesu Hydrroelectric Power Plant icluded our group on purchase agreement with Aksa Energy .The facility located in Çorum Province operates with 15 MW installed power.</p>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/balikesir-samli-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi/?lang=en\"><img width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/8.3.3-AKSA_ENERJI_SAMLI_RES_IMG_0824.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/balikesir-samli-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi/?lang=en\" title=\"No Comments\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span>0</span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t</ul>\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ace925facbe5a5c8bdd9519fa5b69cfb0d599387210a8e21f633a804e1c6e47d?s=46&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\" height=\"46\" width=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\n\n\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/author/ufukozturk/?lang=en\" title=\"Posts by Ufuk Ozturk\" rel=\"author\">Ufuk Ozturk</a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<span>Wednesday, 03 January 2018</span>\n\t\t\t<span>/</span>\n\t\t\t<span>Published in</span> <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/category/genel/?lang=en\" rel=\"category tag\">Genel</a>\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/balikesir-samli-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi/?lang=en\" rel=\"bookmark\">BALIKESİR ŞAMLI WIND POWER PLANT AGREEMENT</a></h3>\n\n    \n\n        \n\n    \n\n<p><span>Şamlı Wind Power Plant icluded our group on purchase agreement with Aksa Energy .The facility located in Balıkesir Province operates with 114 MW installed power.</span></p>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/hatay-sebenoba-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi-2/?lang=en\"><img width=\"1320\" height=\"990\" src=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/11.5.2.4-8.5.2.30-Sebenoba.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/hatay-sebenoba-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi-2/?lang=en\" title=\"No Comments\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span>0</span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t</ul>\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ace925facbe5a5c8bdd9519fa5b69cfb0d599387210a8e21f633a804e1c6e47d?s=46&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\" height=\"46\" width=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\n\n\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/author/ufukozturk/?lang=en\" title=\"Posts by Ufuk Ozturk\" rel=\"author\">Ufuk Ozturk</a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<span>Wednesday, 03 January 2018</span>\n\t\t\t<span>/</span>\n\t\t\t<span>Published in</span> <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/category/genel/?lang=en\" rel=\"category tag\">Genel</a>\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/hatay-sebenoba-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi-2/?lang=en\" rel=\"bookmark\">HATAY SEBENOBA WIND POWER PLANT AGREEMENT</a></h3>\n\n    \n\n        \n\n    \n\n<p>Sebenova Wind Power Plant icluded our group on purchase agreement with Aksa Energy .The facility located in Hatay Province operates with 60 MW installed power.</p>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/manisa-karakurt-ruzgar-santrali-anlasmasi/?lang=en\"><img width=\"1000\" height=\"398\" src=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/11.5.1.1-8.5.1.1-AKSA_ENERJI_KARAKU