p on purchase agreement with Aksa Energy .The facility located in Ordu Province operates with 81.08 MW installed power.</span></p>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/qstec-ile-mutabakat-zapti-imzalandi/?lang=en\"><img width=\"1320\" height=\"866\" src=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/timthumb-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/qstec-ile-mutabakat-zapti-imzalandi/?lang=en\" title=\"No Comments\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span>0</span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t</ul>\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/50b1e472024c096374c97ec49969e4c769e5c53e6a2f30b84200271f0ce63b63?s=46&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g\" height=\"46\" width=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\n\n\t\t<a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/author/fernasadmin/?lang=en\" title=\"Posts by fernasadmin\" rel=\"author\">fernasadmin</a>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<span>Monday, 14 November 2016</span>\n\t\t\t<span>/</span>\n\t\t\t<span>Published in</span> <a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/category/genel/?lang=en\" rel=\"category tag\">Genel</a>\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/qstec-ile-mutabakat-zapti-imzalandi/?lang=en\" rel=\"bookmark\">MOU was signed with QSTec…</a></h3>\n\n    \n\n        \n\n    \n\n<p><strong>Fernas and Qatar Solar Technologies (QSTec) decided to cooperate in the field of solar energy.</strong></p>\n<p>Fernas and Qatar Solar Technologies (QSTec) signed a memorandum of understanding in the field of solar equipment applications and R&amp;D activities.<br>\nThis collaboration agreement aims to strengthen Turkey’s energy diversification and solar power industry</p>\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n\n    <ul><li><span>1</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.fernas.com.tr/news/page/2/?lang=en\"><span>2</span></a></li></ul>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t